Output ../public/demos/tui.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "source /labnotes/docs/demos/setup.sh"
Enter
Sleep 20s
Show

Type "uvx labnotes experiments sweep run"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "j"
Sleep 400ms
Type "n"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "+"
Sleep 3s
Type "k"
Sleep 400ms
Type "k"
Sleep 400ms
Type "k"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 8s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
